    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels like there isn't any way to \"heal\" from this. everything is just getting worse and more expensive. i look at my husband having to work extra shifts just to cover my treatments and i just feel sick. sometimes i think if i wasn't even in the picture, they could finally breathe and actually have a life again. like, wouldn't they be better off if they didn't have to worry about me anymore?",
